# What stays out of the image. baked/ is NOT listed: the full image (Dockerfile) takes the six
# indexes from it. A local index left in a backend's data/ folder would ship instead of the baked
# one, and start.sh would treat it as already seeded; so would a stray .crawled marker.
.git
.github
.oss-scanner
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm
.crawled
